WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.120 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 25=

01:45.480 --> 01:50.360
(Examination Hall)

01:50.440 --> 01:52.080
Easy, easy.

01:53.400 --> 01:54.200
Be careful with that.

01:55.840 --> 01:57.080
Put it over there.

01:57.160 --> 01:58.000
Yes, that's the spot.

01:58.760 --> 02:00.560
Put three tables on that side.

02:02.800 --> 02:03.880
That one. Turn it sideways.

02:04.320 --> 02:05.680
-Yes, like that.
-Wang Xi.

02:05.800 --> 02:07.000
-Hey, Wang Xi.
-That's right.

02:07.080 --> 02:07.840
Yes, Your Highness.

02:08.000 --> 02:09.520
Go prepare some rations.

02:09.720 --> 02:11.880
These candidates have come
from all over the country.

02:12.000 --> 02:13.520
Especially those from poor families,

02:13.680 --> 02:14.920
some might not have eaten a thing.

02:15.000 --> 02:16.560
I'll also set up a barrel
of spring water.

02:16.640 --> 02:18.600
They can drink with a ladle
if they're thirsty,

02:18.840 --> 02:19.960
and take food as needed.

02:20.200 --> 02:21.640
That sounds like a good plan.

02:22.360 --> 02:23.480
Go on and get everything ready.

02:23.600 --> 02:24.240
Yes, Your Highness.

02:24.320 --> 02:25.360
I'll see to it right away.

02:29.200 --> 02:29.800
Come with me.

02:29.880 --> 02:32.000
Make sure there's enough food
for all the examinees.

02:45.360 --> 02:45.960
You go ahead.

02:46.680 --> 02:47.600
Stick to the plan.

02:58.160 --> 02:58.920
Don't stop me.

02:59.200 --> 03:00.440
Hu, think this through.

03:00.600 --> 03:01.760
I said, don't stop me!

03:02.480 --> 03:03.320
If I don't stand up,

03:03.520 --> 03:04.480
who will?

03:05.480 --> 03:07.520
Hu, what about your family?

03:07.920 --> 03:08.920
It's because of them

03:09.000 --> 03:10.480
that I can no longer keep this quiet.

03:11.080 --> 03:11.680
Li,

03:11.840 --> 03:12.560
if you stop me again,

03:12.680 --> 03:14.680
don't blame me for forsaking
our years of friendship.

03:14.760 --> 03:15.560
What are you two doing?

03:15.640 --> 03:17.480
Why are you arguing
in front of the exam hall?

03:18.480 --> 03:20.640
You two barely study to begin with,

03:21.160 --> 03:22.520
and now you're spreading rumors?

03:23.480 --> 03:24.760
You're just afraid of failing.

03:25.240 --> 03:26.280
So you're stirring up trouble

03:26.360 --> 03:27.600
and bringing others down with you.

03:27.680 --> 03:28.320
What did you say?

03:28.400 --> 03:31.040
What do you think you're doing,
shouting in the examination hall?

03:31.200 --> 03:31.800
Just leave.

03:32.200 --> 03:32.800
I…

03:32.920 --> 03:33.920
Just go.

03:41.760 --> 03:42.480
Excuse me, mister.

03:43.960 --> 03:44.640
Your Highness.

03:45.680 --> 03:47.960
What were you arguing about just now?

03:49.640 --> 03:51.360
Lately, there have been rumors

03:51.680 --> 03:53.360
about Prince Wuhen selling
exam questions.

03:53.680 --> 03:54.920
But there's no proof.

03:55.040 --> 03:57.080
It's taken years to reopen
the imperial examination.

03:57.160 --> 03:58.960
We can't let it all fall apart
over hearsay.

04:00.440 --> 04:01.040
How about this?

04:01.600 --> 04:02.760
Then do your best to prepare.

04:03.360 --> 04:04.200
I'll look into

04:04.760 --> 04:05.520
this matter.

04:16.880 --> 04:20.200
(Chunyue Pavilion)

04:23.320 --> 04:25.120
Little lady, are you drunk already?

04:25.320 --> 04:26.360
Come on, drink more.

04:26.680 --> 04:28.200
Your friend isn't here yet.

04:29.680 --> 04:30.680
Forget about him.

04:31.120 --> 04:33.200
If you don't like the food or wine,

04:33.560 --> 04:34.920
I will replace everything for you.

04:35.680 --> 04:38.240
Money's not a problem for me.

04:38.800 --> 04:40.920
Your Highness,
you're so dashing and generous.

04:48.440 --> 04:49.040
Wuhen.

04:50.880 --> 04:51.560
Your Highness.

04:57.560 --> 04:58.440
Oh, Wuxia.

04:58.880 --> 04:59.800
What brings you here?

05:04.320 --> 05:05.680
Ladies, could you give us a moment?

05:08.440 --> 05:09.320
Why should they leave?

05:09.880 --> 05:11.480
There's nothing here to hide.

05:12.560 --> 05:13.560
Besides,

05:14.200 --> 05:16.560
with a beauty like this in my arms,

05:16.880 --> 05:18.200
I can even put up

05:18.320 --> 05:19.800
with your pompous talk.

05:37.200 --> 05:38.880
You two, leave us.

05:39.320 --> 05:40.920
I need to talk to my brother.

05:53.760 --> 05:54.680
Mu Wuhen,

05:55.120 --> 05:56.680
do you know what crime you've committed

05:57.880 --> 05:59.120
for selling the exam questions?

06:06.600 --> 06:08.400
Mu Wuxia, who do you think you are?

06:08.480 --> 06:10.640
-Let's go.
-Trying to throw your weight around?

06:10.720 --> 06:12.720
Someone's messing
with the integrity of the exams.

06:12.800 --> 06:13.800
Of course, I'll step in.

06:19.960 --> 06:22.400
(Examination Hall)

06:24.240 --> 06:24.920
Next.

06:27.880 --> 06:28.480
Sir,

06:28.760 --> 06:30.360
I'm Li Dian, styled Kui'an.

06:30.560 --> 06:31.240
From Qufu.

06:31.520 --> 06:32.600
Words alone are no evidence.

06:32.720 --> 06:35.080
Where's the travel slip issued
by your commanding official?

06:36.240 --> 06:37.000
Next.

06:40.200 --> 06:40.800
Next.

06:43.680 --> 06:44.360
Only half a slip?

06:44.960 --> 06:46.120
I can't even read the writing.

06:46.440 --> 06:47.040
It's invalid.

06:47.680 --> 06:48.280
Move along.

06:48.680 --> 06:51.560
(Li Dian, Scholar of Humble Origins)
Sir, I was robbed on the road.

06:51.920 --> 06:53.120
They took everything.

06:53.680 --> 06:54.320
I risked my life

06:54.440 --> 06:55.880
to grab back my slip.

06:56.360 --> 06:58.000
That's how it was torn in half.

06:58.320 --> 07:00.440
I'm not afraid of being laughed at.

07:00.720 --> 07:02.320
-But I begged all the way here.
-Next.

07:02.440 --> 07:04.000
I don't care
if you flew here on a crane.

07:04.080 --> 07:05.440
I only care if you have your slip.

07:05.760 --> 07:07.200
One that is not torn, get it?

07:07.680 --> 07:08.600
It has been twenty years.

07:08.680 --> 07:10.760
I finally have the opportunity
to retake the exam.

07:11.640 --> 07:14.120
The people in my village
are counting on me.

07:14.440 --> 07:15.560
If I can't sit the exam,

07:15.920 --> 07:18.200
how will I ever face them again, sir?

07:18.680 --> 07:19.560
That's your problem,

07:19.800 --> 07:20.800
not mine.

07:21.320 --> 07:22.680
I'm only a clerk.

07:22.880 --> 07:24.120
Don't call me "sir."

07:25.000 --> 07:25.720
Move along now.

07:25.800 --> 07:26.400
Sir…

07:26.480 --> 07:27.360
Don't waste time.

07:27.480 --> 07:28.280
Sir, is there a way…

07:28.360 --> 07:28.960
Next.

07:29.200 --> 07:31.080
This slip is not fake, sir.

07:31.200 --> 07:31.800
Next.

07:32.000 --> 07:32.600
I…

07:45.120 --> 07:45.880
Excuse me, mister.

07:47.000 --> 07:47.880
Could you explain

07:48.240 --> 07:49.040
what Laozi meant

07:49.120 --> 07:52.000
by "Heaven and Earth show no mercy,
treating everything as insignificant"?

07:52.320 --> 07:53.480
What do you think it means?

07:55.640 --> 07:57.000
This is from the Dao De Jing,

07:57.760 --> 07:59.440
Chapter Five.

08:00.000 --> 08:02.240
It means that the world is abiding

08:02.360 --> 08:03.920
by natural law,

08:04.560 --> 08:05.840
favoring no one

08:05.920 --> 08:07.240
and letting things grow freely.

08:07.760 --> 08:09.120
Though it sounds merciless,

08:09.560 --> 08:11.360
it reflects the truth of nature.

08:11.560 --> 08:12.680
The Dao follows its course

08:12.840 --> 08:13.760
without interference.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.680
Well said.

08:18.320 --> 08:19.200
You're too kind.

08:19.920 --> 08:21.680
I'm only a poor scholar
from the countryside

08:21.880 --> 08:22.920
with little learning.

08:23.480 --> 08:24.880
And now I can't even take the exam.

08:25.200 --> 08:26.320
Who says you can't?

08:28.880 --> 08:29.760
But my slip…

08:40.919 --> 08:43.400
This exam is to select talent,

08:43.840 --> 08:45.080
not to chase slips of paper.

08:47.800 --> 08:48.400
Wang Xi.

08:49.920 --> 08:50.520
Yes?

08:51.160 --> 08:51.760
Someone,

08:52.040 --> 08:52.640
take him away.

08:55.720 --> 08:57.080
Have mercy, Your Highness.

08:57.440 --> 08:58.560
Make sure Li Dian's name

08:58.640 --> 09:00.080
-is registered.
-Your Highness.

09:00.200 --> 09:01.080
Yes, Prince Wuxia.

09:05.680 --> 09:07.600
You haven't taken the exam,
nor earned a title.

09:07.800 --> 09:09.440
I can't accept such a formal bow.

09:09.720 --> 09:10.400
Prince Wuxia.

09:11.520 --> 09:13.800
Even if I fail this time,

09:14.800 --> 09:16.200
I'll return to retake the exam.

09:16.400 --> 09:18.200
From this day on,
I consider you my patron.

09:18.840 --> 09:19.440
You…

09:23.920 --> 09:24.920
Then it's a promise.

09:26.280 --> 09:28.320
If you all truly have talent,

09:28.920 --> 09:29.680
I, Mu Wuxia,

09:29.920 --> 09:31.280
will be your patron.

09:31.720 --> 09:33.320
All I ask is that, when you enter court,

09:33.640 --> 09:34.600
you remain upright, loyal,

09:34.680 --> 09:36.280
serve the country with all your heart,

09:36.720 --> 09:39.920
and bring peace and prosperity to Qi.

09:41.320 --> 09:42.080
Prince Wuxia.

09:43.200 --> 09:44.560
If I'm ever appointed,

09:45.320 --> 09:46.600
I'll be a beacon of integrity.

09:47.320 --> 09:49.680
I won't let you down.

09:51.080 --> 09:52.880
-We will do the same.
-We will do the same.

10:06.160 --> 10:07.320
Imperial Guards! Make way!

10:11.840 --> 10:12.440
Prince Wuxia.

10:14.560 --> 10:17.040
What brings the Imperial Guards here?

10:17.520 --> 10:18.400
By His Majesty's order,

10:18.480 --> 10:21.280
you are to return to the residence
and refrain from receiving visitors.

10:21.680 --> 10:22.280
Father?

10:26.400 --> 10:28.920
Last night, Prince Wuhen was found dead.

10:29.160 --> 10:31.200
A report claims you were involved.

10:41.720 --> 10:42.400
Your Majesty,

10:43.160 --> 10:44.000
Prince Wuhen

10:44.080 --> 10:45.680
was my sister's only remaining son.

10:46.800 --> 10:49.080
For the sake
of the Qin family's loyalty,

10:49.680 --> 10:53.800
I beg Your Majesty
to punish Prince Wuxia.

10:55.840 --> 10:57.080
Look at me.

11:02.400 --> 11:03.400
Tell me.

11:04.280 --> 11:07.200
Did you see Wuxia kill him?

11:14.200 --> 11:17.080
The matter is under investigation.

11:18.520 --> 11:19.160
Your Majesty,

11:19.600 --> 11:20.920
multiple witnesses confirm

11:21.040 --> 11:22.840
that the two princes had an argument.

11:23.160 --> 11:26.040
Wuhen was found dead
in a tavern soon after.

11:27.040 --> 11:29.080
Your Majesty,
please seek justice for Wuhen

11:29.440 --> 11:30.800
and punish Prince Wuxia.

11:34.080 --> 11:36.320
May Your Majesty see this
with clear judgment.

11:38.720 --> 11:40.800
-May Your Majesty issue an edict
-May Your Majesty issue an edict

11:40.920 --> 11:42.800
-and bring the culprit to justice.
-and bring the culprit to justice.

11:54.160 --> 11:56.800
I've already lost one son.

11:58.800 --> 12:00.040
Now, you're asking me

12:00.160 --> 12:02.200
to give up another?

12:06.920 --> 12:07.800
Get out. All of you.

12:09.800 --> 12:10.600
If you don't leave,

12:12.080 --> 12:14.560
I'll see you executed first!

12:36.320 --> 12:36.920
Your Majesty.

12:39.520 --> 12:40.160
Your Majesty.

12:41.560 --> 12:43.440
Quick. Bring my pills!

12:43.960 --> 12:44.800
The pills.

12:45.200 --> 12:46.200
Yes, Your Majesty.

12:51.440 --> 12:52.080
Wuhen.

12:53.920 --> 12:54.800
Wuhen…

12:57.840 --> 12:59.200
Wuhen…

13:20.440 --> 13:21.320
Your Majesty.

13:25.400 --> 13:26.320
Wuhen

13:27.920 --> 13:29.720
may not have been the most capable.

13:32.440 --> 13:34.960
But he was still my son.

13:38.320 --> 13:40.040
First, it was Wugou.

13:40.800 --> 13:41.560
Now,

13:42.040 --> 13:42.680
it's Wuhen.

13:43.200 --> 13:45.040
One by one, they're all gone.

13:47.680 --> 13:50.440
I call myself "the lonely king"
every day.

13:51.800 --> 13:53.280
Will I end up truly alone,

13:55.960 --> 13:58.040
with no one left to call my own?

13:59.160 --> 14:00.080
How could that be?

14:00.920 --> 14:01.520
Your Majesty,

14:02.520 --> 14:03.800
you still have me.

14:08.680 --> 14:10.400
Luckily, I still have you.

14:15.800 --> 14:18.080
Your Majesty, the Left Chancellor
requests an audience.

14:21.400 --> 14:22.200
I will not see him.

14:24.560 --> 14:25.200
Your Majesty,

14:26.160 --> 14:27.560
he's your most trusted official.

14:28.200 --> 14:29.680
How can you not see him?

14:36.440 --> 14:39.280
He must have come for Wuxia.

14:41.400 --> 14:42.000
My dear,

14:44.080 --> 14:45.200
this fratricide

14:45.800 --> 14:46.720
must not go unpunished.

14:48.040 --> 14:49.440
Or else Qi will fall.

14:52.200 --> 14:52.920
Let him in.

14:55.320 --> 14:56.040
Go on ahead.

15:11.200 --> 15:13.560
Then I'll take my leave first.

15:25.080 --> 15:26.400
Bring my pills.

15:29.040 --> 15:30.040
Here it is, Your Majesty.

15:36.800 --> 15:37.520
You may go.

15:43.880 --> 15:44.920
Summon the Left Chancellor.

15:49.280 --> 15:50.200
Greetings, Your Majesty.

15:51.000 --> 15:53.160
Do you know of the tragedy
that befell the Zhao State?

15:55.360 --> 15:55.960
I do not.

15:56.040 --> 15:57.440
In the chaos of the Five Kingdoms,

15:57.520 --> 15:58.720
the Zhao State was the strongest.

15:58.840 --> 16:01.000
But their royal family destroyed itself
through infighting.

16:01.080 --> 16:02.800
Eventually, with no heirs left,

16:03.320 --> 16:05.320
the state was divided.

16:05.520 --> 16:07.520
Indeed, fratricide is truly
the greatest tragedy.

16:08.200 --> 16:09.720
But from what I know of Prince Wuxia,

16:10.080 --> 16:11.560
he would never do such a thing.

16:12.560 --> 16:14.040
And yet so many have testified.

16:14.320 --> 16:15.800
Are you here trying

16:16.040 --> 16:17.480
to protect a wolf in sheep's clothing?

16:17.560 --> 16:19.440
I've taken many lives
of such people in my day.

16:20.040 --> 16:21.400
I don't dare dispute Your Majesty.

16:22.200 --> 16:24.160
But this case is riddled with suspicion.

16:24.560 --> 16:26.320
May I interrogate Prince Wuxia myself?

16:26.680 --> 16:27.440
I've already ordered

16:27.520 --> 16:30.120
that no one is to enter his residence
or seek audience with him.

16:30.200 --> 16:32.280
Then may I at least assist
with the investigation?

16:33.160 --> 16:34.400
You can't be distracted now.

16:34.720 --> 16:36.320
The imperial exam is near,

16:36.640 --> 16:38.200
and Wuyin has only just been appointed.

16:38.560 --> 16:39.800
Go and assist him.

16:41.320 --> 16:41.960
Prince Wuyin?

16:42.160 --> 16:43.720
I've appointed him
as the chief examiner.

16:43.800 --> 16:45.600
Meng Zhongyan is reinstated
to his former post

16:46.400 --> 16:48.080
and appointed as a co-examiner

16:48.560 --> 16:50.920
to assist Wuyin in overseeing
the imperial examinations.

16:53.800 --> 16:54.560
You may go.

16:57.560 --> 16:58.320
Yes, Your Majesty.

17:08.839 --> 17:09.440
(Shen Residence)

17:09.520 --> 17:12.160
If we can't see Prince Wuxia,
we won't be able to find out the truth.

17:12.240 --> 17:14.079
The investigation will be all
the more difficult.

17:14.160 --> 17:16.000
We have to investigate,
however hard it gets.

17:16.359 --> 17:18.079
There's no way
Prince Wuxia is the killer.

17:19.839 --> 17:21.480
Should we go to the scene now

17:21.560 --> 17:22.720
and look for clues?

17:22.960 --> 17:23.560
No.

17:24.079 --> 17:26.480
The Imperial Guards
have already intervened in this matter.

17:26.680 --> 17:28.160
They are on high alert during the day.

17:28.800 --> 17:29.600
We can go tonight.

17:31.120 --> 17:32.120
For now, let the word out

17:32.800 --> 17:34.160
that I'm too busy with the exam

17:34.400 --> 17:35.120
to receive guests.

17:35.440 --> 17:36.440
We must uncover the truth

17:36.560 --> 17:37.800
before the exams begin.

17:38.320 --> 17:40.120
If we don't, all our efforts

17:40.520 --> 17:41.520
will be in vain.

17:42.320 --> 17:43.320
Understood. I'll go now.

17:48.240 --> 17:50.880
(Meng Residence)

17:59.320 --> 18:00.040
Ms. Zhenzhen.

18:21.640 --> 18:22.320
Search the place.

18:24.080 --> 18:25.320
Zhenzhen, what's going on?

18:25.400 --> 18:26.800
If you needed something from me,

18:26.880 --> 18:28.160
a message would have sufficed.

18:28.800 --> 18:30.800
Why bring your noble feet
into my lowly courtyard?

18:31.000 --> 18:33.240
Does Prince Wuhen's death
have anything to do with you?

18:33.560 --> 18:34.960
That was His Majesty's son.

18:35.080 --> 18:36.120
Even if I have the courage,

18:36.240 --> 18:37.440
I wouldn't dare do such a thing.

18:37.520 --> 18:39.400
Then why were you sneaking
around Chunyue Pavilion

18:39.480 --> 18:40.800
and slipping away just as quietly?

18:40.960 --> 18:42.400
Prince Wuhen died that night.

18:43.120 --> 18:45.640
I'm sure you've heard

18:46.200 --> 18:47.960
it was Prince Wuxia
who barged into the tavern

18:48.080 --> 18:49.840
and fought with Prince Wuhen that night.

18:49.920 --> 18:52.320
In a moment of rage,
he accidentally killed Prince Wuhen.

18:54.960 --> 18:56.480
So, was it really a gentleman's fury

18:56.960 --> 18:57.960
that turned deadly?

19:02.120 --> 19:03.400
What are you hiding in your hand?

19:05.760 --> 19:06.360
Nothing.

19:17.560 --> 19:18.760
Where did you get this?

19:20.360 --> 19:21.880
Are you trying to ruin the Meng family?

19:22.160 --> 19:22.760
No, I'm not.

19:23.120 --> 19:24.960
It's only a plain jade pendant.

19:34.400 --> 19:36.280
"Regret not the past,

19:37.560 --> 19:39.560
take righteousness as profit."

19:52.120 --> 19:55.040
Congratulations on your new role
as the Chief Examiner.

19:56.520 --> 19:59.640
And to Right Chancellor Meng
for his reinstatement too.

19:59.760 --> 20:01.760
The Mengs rise once more
to lead the noble clans.

20:02.040 --> 20:02.640
Have a seat.

20:09.720 --> 20:11.640
You know I prefer peace and quiet.

20:12.880 --> 20:13.960
Your father will bear much

20:14.760 --> 20:16.000
of the burden of this exam.

20:18.400 --> 20:20.520
The Meng family stands ready
to serve Your Highness.

20:21.000 --> 20:23.120
We trust you'll watch over us in return.

20:26.560 --> 20:28.480
"A gift from heaven unclaimed
brings misfortune,

20:29.480 --> 20:30.800
a chance ignored becomes a curse.

20:31.880 --> 20:33.280
Miss the moment,

20:34.880 --> 20:36.400
and you'll pay the price."

20:39.560 --> 20:40.880
Wuhen and I

20:41.600 --> 20:42.840
were always close.

20:44.560 --> 20:46.320
Wuxia may be my brother too.

20:47.960 --> 20:49.760
But he has completely lost his mind.

20:52.720 --> 20:54.800
I won't let anyone clear his name.

20:59.600 --> 21:02.480
As for that lowly pawn
who got caught in the crossfire,

21:03.720 --> 21:05.080
I assume I don't need to spell out

21:07.080 --> 21:08.760
what should be done?

21:21.760 --> 21:22.480
Your Highness,

21:23.480 --> 21:26.480
there's one more thing that troubles me.

21:27.120 --> 21:28.080
Speak.

21:29.800 --> 21:31.360
From what I've gathered,

21:31.800 --> 21:33.080
this exam only happened

21:33.720 --> 21:35.160
thanks to Shen Zaiye,

21:36.080 --> 21:38.560
not Prince Wuxia.

21:39.640 --> 21:41.720
I still suspect Li Jiaohan's case

21:41.800 --> 21:42.640
is linked to him.

21:43.760 --> 21:44.360
So

21:45.040 --> 21:47.800
I believe Shen Zaiye and Prince Wuxia

21:48.800 --> 21:50.000
have some secret connection.

21:53.720 --> 21:54.360
A valid point.

21:56.320 --> 21:57.960
But don't worry.

21:58.560 --> 22:00.320
I already have someone watching him.

22:01.840 --> 22:02.720
You planted a spy?

22:03.600 --> 22:05.080
By Shen Zaiye's side?

22:05.640 --> 22:06.960
Let me tell you a secret.

22:09.320 --> 22:11.320
Jiang Taohua is currently staying
in my residence.

22:12.960 --> 22:16.000
Princess Chengping? In your residence?

22:20.920 --> 22:22.240
It's just as you have predicted.

22:22.480 --> 22:24.080
Shen Zaiye came to rescue her.

22:24.400 --> 22:25.400
Jiang Taohua,

22:25.760 --> 22:27.640
I knew you wouldn't die so easily.

22:29.160 --> 22:30.480
What's the next step, Master?

22:31.320 --> 22:35.280
Why would Jiang Taohua remain
at Prince Wuyin's residence?

22:39.760 --> 22:41.560
She hit her head
when she fell from a cliff.

22:42.120 --> 22:43.560
She is still mentally disoriented

22:45.560 --> 22:46.800
and has lost her memories.

22:48.360 --> 22:50.240
Now she follows my every word.

23:11.080 --> 23:11.800
Your Highness,

23:12.880 --> 23:14.640
why did you summon me?

23:15.360 --> 23:15.960
Sit.

23:21.480 --> 23:22.320
Miss Meng,

23:23.240 --> 23:25.040
I have a task for you.

23:26.560 --> 23:27.960
At your command, Your Highness.

23:29.080 --> 23:30.280
You've been resting for months.

23:31.000 --> 23:32.640
Wouldn't it be nice

23:33.200 --> 23:34.360
to stretch your legs a little?

23:36.040 --> 23:38.040
A major event has shaken the court.

23:39.000 --> 23:42.400
My brother Wuxia has murdered Wuhen.

23:43.280 --> 23:44.960
There are witnesses
and concrete evidence.

23:45.720 --> 23:46.840
There's no turning it around.

23:48.080 --> 23:49.880
But Shen Zaiye will not let it go.

23:50.320 --> 23:51.080
He'll look into it.

23:51.760 --> 23:53.160
I want to know what he finds.

23:54.080 --> 23:55.560
So I need you

23:56.320 --> 23:57.560
to get close to him.

23:58.320 --> 23:59.760
If there's any sign of movement,

24:01.040 --> 24:02.240
report back to me immediately.

24:05.240 --> 24:07.560
(Prince Wuxia would never kill
his own brother.)

24:08.520 --> 24:10.480
(But why is Prince Wuyin so sure)

24:10.600 --> 24:12.320
(Shen Zaiye will try to clear his name?)

24:15.720 --> 24:17.640
What? You can't do it?

24:18.640 --> 24:19.480
No, it's not that.

24:20.560 --> 24:21.840
I was just thinking

24:21.920 --> 24:23.320
it's been months since we last met.

24:24.040 --> 24:25.280
Getting close to him now

24:25.360 --> 24:27.160
without raising suspicion won't be easy.

24:30.160 --> 24:32.400
His sister, Xiang Qingying,

24:34.280 --> 24:35.280
is simple-minded.

24:36.400 --> 24:38.360
And she's grown quite close to Wuxia.

24:39.080 --> 24:39.760
I suppose

24:41.560 --> 24:42.960
she might be the key.

24:45.120 --> 24:46.840
Thank you for the guidance,
Your Highness.

25:00.080 --> 25:02.720
Mu Wuxia, I swear I'll get you out.

25:03.800 --> 25:04.600
Qingying.

25:12.800 --> 25:15.800
Jiang Taohua? What are you doing here?

25:16.000 --> 25:18.160
I want to visit Qingtai
at the Chancellor's residence.

25:21.240 --> 25:21.840
Are…

25:23.800 --> 25:24.800
Are you crying?

25:28.000 --> 25:29.080
Jiang Taohua,

25:29.480 --> 25:30.720
do you know

25:30.840 --> 25:33.120
Mu Wuxia has been wrongly accused
of killing Prince Wuhen?

25:33.200 --> 25:34.560
He's now locked up in his residence,

25:34.640 --> 25:36.320
completely cut off
from the outside world.

25:36.480 --> 25:37.360
Prince Wuxia?

25:39.080 --> 25:41.320
You know him, Qingying?

25:42.520 --> 25:43.400
Not just me.

25:43.600 --> 25:44.960
You knew him too.

25:49.120 --> 25:51.480
But you don't remember anymore.

25:52.800 --> 25:54.800
Mu Wuxia always looked out for you

25:55.040 --> 25:56.480
and helped you more than once.

25:57.040 --> 25:58.160
After you fell off the cliff,

25:58.400 --> 25:59.440
he even stood up for you

25:59.520 --> 26:01.400
and had a big argument
with my brother over it.

26:03.600 --> 26:06.080
I've heard
that Prince Wuxia is a man of honor.

26:06.560 --> 26:07.640
It turns out to be true.

26:08.640 --> 26:10.400
Since I have received kindness from him,

26:10.560 --> 26:12.720
I cannot stand by and do nothing.

26:13.480 --> 26:14.320
Wherever you're going,

26:14.480 --> 26:15.320
I'm coming with you.

26:17.560 --> 26:18.480
Jiang Taohua,

26:20.360 --> 26:22.120
I didn't expect you to be so loyal.

26:22.480 --> 26:24.080
I was on my way to see him.

26:24.720 --> 26:25.600
Where?

26:28.320 --> 26:30.040
Zaiye said
His Majesty gave strict orders.

26:30.640 --> 26:32.360
No one is allowed to see Mu Wuxia.

26:33.600 --> 26:34.240
But

26:34.880 --> 26:36.720
no one can stop me and my sword.

26:37.160 --> 26:38.040
Qingying,

26:39.240 --> 26:40.640
barging into Prince Wuxia's residence

26:40.760 --> 26:42.400
will only make things worse for him.

26:43.960 --> 26:44.560
How about this?

26:45.160 --> 26:46.720
We go and check the scene of the crime.

26:46.960 --> 26:48.840
Maybe we'll find something useful.

26:49.360 --> 26:50.560
What matters now

26:51.000 --> 26:52.280
is to clear Prince Wuxia's name.

26:53.640 --> 26:54.720
You have a point. Let's go.

26:54.880 --> 26:55.840
I know where it happened.

26:55.920 --> 26:56.760
-Come.
-Let's go.

26:58.120 --> 26:59.520
(Chunyue Pavilion)

27:15.120 --> 27:15.720
Who's there?

27:22.880 --> 27:24.160
(What are they doing here?)

27:31.280 --> 27:32.480
There's a noise by the river.

27:32.720 --> 27:33.560
You two, check it out.

27:33.960 --> 27:34.560
Yes, sir.

27:35.560 --> 27:36.160
Let's go.

27:36.880 --> 27:38.080
Let's use the back entrance.

27:49.320 --> 27:50.080
Stop right there.

28:08.800 --> 28:09.400
Zaiye?

28:10.520 --> 28:12.120
Have you been following us?

28:22.280 --> 28:23.800
Zaiye, say something.

28:25.000 --> 28:26.280
Didn't I tell you to stay home

28:26.560 --> 28:28.040
and stay out of this?

28:29.080 --> 28:30.400
Mu Wuxia's still locked up.

28:30.600 --> 28:31.840
How am I supposed to sit still?

28:35.800 --> 28:36.560
And

28:37.120 --> 28:38.280
what are you two doing here?

28:39.960 --> 28:41.160
I just snuck out of the residence

28:41.280 --> 28:42.040
and hadn't gone far

28:42.240 --> 28:43.800
when I ran into her looking for Qingtai.

28:44.320 --> 28:46.480
I told her what happened.

28:49.800 --> 28:52.160
Zaiye, the moment she heard
Prince Wuxia was in trouble,

28:52.280 --> 28:53.240
she insisted on helping.

28:53.320 --> 28:54.760
So, how could I back out?

28:55.240 --> 28:57.040
Besides, we came here
to look for evidence.

28:57.120 --> 28:58.520
It can help to clear Mu Wuxia's name.

28:58.600 --> 28:59.880
We're not here to cause trouble.

29:05.880 --> 29:07.680
Even the Princess knew
to dress in disguise.

29:07.840 --> 29:09.480
But you?
Just strutting around like this?

29:10.080 --> 29:12.040
Zaiye, are you taking us with you?

29:14.800 --> 29:15.840
Then wait for me.

29:17.440 --> 29:18.040
I'll go with you.

29:18.120 --> 29:18.760
Miss Meng.

29:24.000 --> 29:25.160
Greetings, Chancellor Shen.

29:27.280 --> 29:28.080
It's been a while.

29:29.320 --> 29:30.240
Miss Meng,

29:30.600 --> 29:31.800
have you remembered something?

29:33.320 --> 29:34.800
Why do you say that, Chancellor Shen?

29:35.760 --> 29:36.480
Do you remember

29:38.560 --> 29:39.760
Prince Wuxia?

29:42.560 --> 29:44.040
Qingying told me

29:44.480 --> 29:46.640
Prince Wuxia helped me many times.

29:46.720 --> 29:48.280
Of course, I'd want to return the favor.

29:50.560 --> 29:51.640
But you're willing to help

29:52.280 --> 29:53.520
just based on what you heard?

29:53.640 --> 29:55.360
Chancellor Shen,
are you interrogating me?

29:55.720 --> 29:56.360
Of course not.

29:56.440 --> 29:58.240
Then I don't see the need
to explain myself.

30:02.040 --> 30:02.640
Go home.

30:03.240 --> 30:04.800
You shouldn't get involved in this mess.

30:05.000 --> 30:06.400
I know exactly what I'm doing.

30:08.080 --> 30:09.320
I don't need you to tell me

30:09.400 --> 30:10.760
what I should or shouldn't do.

30:12.320 --> 30:13.520
We clearly can't see eye to eye.

30:13.600 --> 30:14.840
So there's no point in talking.

30:19.760 --> 30:20.360
Very well.

30:22.000 --> 30:22.960
In that case,

30:24.360 --> 30:25.480
I'll go ahead first.

30:57.000 --> 30:57.600
Where is he?

30:58.520 --> 30:59.520
He has already left.

30:59.800 --> 31:00.840
We're splitting up.

31:01.320 --> 31:02.240
Did you two argue?

31:02.800 --> 31:03.720
Qingying.

31:04.160 --> 31:05.400
Whatever happened between me

31:05.480 --> 31:06.760
and the Chancellor in the past

31:07.000 --> 31:08.280
is already in the past.

31:08.360 --> 31:09.600
We're just strangers now.

31:10.400 --> 31:12.080
How did you two end up like this?

31:12.880 --> 31:13.560
Let's go.

31:50.080 --> 31:52.120
(Prince Wuhen must've hit his head.)

31:52.440 --> 31:53.800
(That's why there's so much blood.)

31:59.080 --> 31:59.720
(These are…)

32:00.880 --> 32:02.280
(Fingernail scratches.)

32:03.720 --> 32:05.160
(He struggled before he died.)

32:06.800 --> 32:08.640
(Prince Wuxia
has never been good at fighting,)

32:09.160 --> 32:10.800
(and Prince Wuhen was much bigger.)

32:11.560 --> 32:13.320
(If they fought, Wuxia would've lost.)

32:20.120 --> 32:21.120
My brother must be inside.

32:21.280 --> 32:21.880
Let's go in.

32:28.120 --> 32:30.360
Zaiye, did you leave this door open
for us on purpose?

32:52.320 --> 32:54.560
So, is this where Prince Wuhen was killed?

32:56.040 --> 32:57.720
Mu Wuxia is not even strong enough.

32:58.240 --> 33:00.320
So he couldn't have killed Prince Wuhen.

33:11.640 --> 33:13.560
(There's blood.)

33:14.120 --> 33:15.760
(But no signs of a fight.)

33:16.480 --> 33:17.360
(Prince Wuhen)

33:17.480 --> 33:18.800
(must have been attacked)

33:19.160 --> 33:20.320
(when he wasn't expecting it.)

33:45.560 --> 33:46.720
(These footprints)

33:47.160 --> 33:49.080
(must be from the killer escaping.)

33:50.560 --> 33:52.080
(The dancer from that night said)

33:52.400 --> 33:54.360
(Prince Wuxia left through
the front door.)

33:55.880 --> 33:56.520
Who's inside?

33:59.720 --> 34:01.560
There's a light upstairs.
Go and check it out.

34:06.640 --> 34:07.720
You, over there.

34:07.960 --> 34:08.560
Yes, sir.

34:10.000 --> 34:10.639
Bring more men.

34:10.880 --> 34:11.480
Follow me.

34:11.560 --> 34:12.520
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

34:45.199 --> 34:49.239
(Shunjing Residence)

34:49.360 --> 34:50.040
Your Highness,

34:51.000 --> 34:52.960
I followed Shen Zaiye to the scene,

34:53.120 --> 34:54.400
and I found a broken piece

34:54.840 --> 34:55.560
of a jade pendant.

34:56.280 --> 34:57.080
A broken jade piece?

34:57.880 --> 34:58.680
What kind?

35:02.480 --> 35:03.720
Something about this size.

35:05.400 --> 35:06.080
All right.

35:08.360 --> 35:09.440
Thank you for your hard work.

35:09.520 --> 35:10.960
You should return and get some rest.

35:11.280 --> 35:12.040
Yes, Your Highness.

35:29.600 --> 35:30.760
(Hua,)

35:31.240 --> 35:33.120
(once I've cleared the path for you,)

35:33.600 --> 35:35.440
(you'll come back to me.)

35:35.720 --> 35:36.640
(Right?)

36:34.080 --> 36:41.080
(Happiness)

37:01.520 --> 37:04.720
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

37:04.800 --> 37:07.840
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

37:08.760 --> 37:11.880
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

37:12.000 --> 37:15.760
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

37:16.040 --> 37:19.120
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

37:19.240 --> 37:22.560
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

37:22.960 --> 37:26.520
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

37:26.600 --> 37:32.320
♪With no one it can be brought♪

37:37.280 --> 37:44.200
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

37:44.640 --> 37:51.480
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

37:51.960 --> 37:58.960
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

37:59.280 --> 38:03.320
♪Even if it means this flower♪

38:03.440 --> 38:10.400
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

38:21.520 --> 38:24.640
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

38:24.720 --> 38:27.960
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

38:28.320 --> 38:32.000
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

38:32.120 --> 38:38.680
♪No longer needing to say♪

38:42.760 --> 38:49.680
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

38:50.080 --> 38:57.040
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

38:57.400 --> 39:04.400
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

39:04.760 --> 39:06.440
♪And finding♪

39:06.520 --> 39:13.520
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
